---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <!-- #hero -->
  <section id="home">
    <h1>Home</h1>
    <p class="w3-margin-top">
        Welcome! Every idea has a spark, and my passion is helping those sparks grow into something remarkable. Through design and photography, I take concepts—big or small—and transform them into visual experiences that tell a story, evoke emotion, and capture attention. Whether it’s a personal project, a brand concept, or a creative collaboration, my goal is to make your vision feel alive, unique, and unforgettable.
    </p>
    <p class="w3-margin-top">
        I believe the best work happens when creativity meets connection. That’s why I take the time to understand your goals, your style, and your story, crafting each project with care and intention. Every detail matters, and every step is an opportunity to create something extraordinary. Thank you for stopping by—let’s explore your ideas together and bring them to life in a way that’s as inspiring as it is authentic.
    </p>
    <!-- Using Ionic Grid System -->
    <ion-grid>
      <ion-row>
        <ion-col size="12" size-md="6">
          <img src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}assets/images/home/placeholder.webp`} alt="Placeholder image 1" class="preview">
        </ion-col>
        <ion-col size="12" size-md="6">
          <img src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}assets/images/home/placeholder.webp`} alt="Placeholder image 2" class="preview">
        </ion-col>
      </ion-row>
      <ion-row>
        <ion-col size="12">
          <img src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}assets/images/home/placeholder.webp`} alt="Placeholder image 3" class="preview">
        </ion-col>
      </ion-row>
    </ion-grid>
  </section>
</Layout>
